cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite the paper below."
title: "RPS-GMM: Time Series Classification of Supraglacial Lakes Evolution over Greenland Ice Sheet"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a computationally efficient time series
  classification approach that fits Gaussian Mixture Models to the Reconstructed
  Phase Spaces of Sentinel-1 backscatter and Sentinel-2 water percentage time
  series, classifying Greenland supraglacial lakes as refreezing, draining, or
  buried from a single representative training sample per class.
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/ehfahad/TSC-of-Supraglacial-Lakes-Evolution-over-GrIS"
version: "1.0.0"
keywords:
  - time series classification
  - reconstructed phase space
  - Gaussian mixture model
  - supraglacial lakes
  - Greenland Ice Sheet
  - Sentinel-1
  - Sentinel-2
  - remote sensing

